WEBVTT

00:12:58.829 --> 00:13:00.579
in order to make progress.

00:13:01.579 --> 00:13:03.871
So I've seen a lot
of advances in computing,

00:13:03.912 --> 00:13:06.204
and how computing, over the past decades,

00:13:06.204 --> 00:13:10.371
has really helped millions of people
better understand the world around them.

00:13:10.412 --> 00:13:13.412
And AI today has the potential
to help billions of people.

00:13:14.204 --> 00:13:16.329
We truly live in exciting times.

00:13:16.746 --> 00:13:17.912
Thank you.

00:13:17.912 --> 00:13:24.912
(Applause)

00:13:27.829 --> 00:13:29.496
Chris Anderson: Thank you so much.

00:13:29.537 --> 00:13:31.912
I want to follow up on a couple things.